    "created_at": "2022-05-14T01:43:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-14T01:43:29Z",
    "body": "This doesn't seem like a good idea. It seems like technical limitations of the testing automation framework you're using are getting in your way, and you should change that framework, instead of asking browsers to introduce new permissions frameworks into a web-exposed API.",
