    "updated_at": "2022-05-17T16:50:20Z",
    "body": "It seems the idea has not a lot of support for now; I'll close the issue in a few days if nobody else thinks it's worth pushing it forward. I'll continue the discussion about the specific testing automation capabilities in the WPT [issue](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/26819). \r\n\r\nThanks a lot for the feedback in any case.",
