    "created_at": "2023-02-02T23:37:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-02T23:37:39Z",
    "body": "Inthe [PR#8267](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8267) we have defined a new Web Driver extension command to provide a way to avoid the user prompt dialog. This would be enough to provide testing automation for the Custom Handler APIs, so perhaps we could close this issue for now. \r\n\r\nIf there is interest in the future to define a specific permission descriptor and, perhaps, making the Custom Handler become a powerful feature, we can reopen it if needed.",
